00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<b>kono shinzou wa kokoro wo motazu</b>

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<b>My heart doesn' </b>t contain a spirit

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:47.080
<b>nemurenai toki wo kizamu dake da yo</b>

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:47.080
<b>It merely marks the passage of sleepless hours</b>

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:50.870
<b>ryoute de tsuchi wo kakiatsumeta</b>

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:50.870
<b>Scraping up bare earth with my two hands</b>

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:56.130
<b>ano hito no kotoba made ume ya shinai zenshin koso</b>

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:56.130
<b>won' </b>t fill the hole left by that person' s words

00:21:56.130 --> 00:22:00.920
<b>jouzu ni karada wo mushibande iku</b>

00:21:56.130 --> 00:22:00.920
<b>which are eating up my body</b>

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:09.180
<b>hora goran yo ano Polaris wo</b>

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:09.180
<b>Just look at that Polaris</b>

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:13.440
<b>uranometoria wo hirogetara</b>

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:13.440
<b>When you open the pages of the Uranometria</b>

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:21.570
<b>yogoreta tenohira ga kiten da to oshiete kureru</b>

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:21.570
<b>It' </b>ll tell you your dirty hands are the reference point

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:26.740
<b>sagasu sagase yo kono samuzora ni</b>

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:26.740
<b>Searching, searching the cold night sky</b>

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:31.200
<b>anata no murui na kagayaki de</b>

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:31.200
<b>for your exceptional brightness</b>

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:44.800
<b>wazuka ni zahyou wo ushinawazu ni koko ni iru no ka</b>

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:44.800
<b>I would have lost the coordinates without you</b>

